This distribution uses the following third-party components:

- @anthropic-ai/claude-code — the Claude Code CLI, invoked by the harness
  as the driver runtime. Installed globally by the user; not vendored.
- google-antigravity — the Google Antigravity Python SDK, installed into
  tools/harness-matrix/sdk-probe/sdkprobe/ by the setup wizard. Used by
  gemini_worker.py to call Gemini models through Vertex AI.
- Node dependencies under packages/*/node_modules/ after `pnpm install`,
  each carrying its own license terms; see their respective LICENSE files.

The harness does not vendor or redistribute Anthropic or Google model
weights. All model calls go to the vendor's own API from the user's own
machine using the user's own credentials.
